<title>ITALY: SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ITALIAN CUP SEMIFINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>NAPLES, Italy 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of an Italian Cup semifinal second leg match on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Napoli 1 Internazionale 1 after extra time, 1-1 after 90 mins.</p>
<p>Aggregate score 2-2.</p>
<p>Napoli won penalty shoot-out 5-3 and play Vicenza in the final.</p>
</text>
